    "course_pol": "本課程以原理講解為主，授課時由教師以板書方式說明各章節之重點內容。為協助學生加深理解與方便日後複習，課堂上要求學生將教師所講解之重點與推導過程確實抄寫於個人筆記中，並加以整理。課堂筆記不僅是複習的重要依據，亦有助於培養學生專注聽講與重點整理之能力。",
    "course_pol_en": "This course focuses on explaining the principles behind the concepts. During lectures, the instructor will use the blackboard to explain the key points of each chapter. To help students deepen their understanding and facilitate future review, students are required to carefully copy the key points and derivations explained by the instructor into their personal notes and organize them. Class notes are not only an important basis for review but also help cultivate students' ability to concentrate on listening and summarizing key points.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>本課程以講述法為主要教學方式，授課時透過黑板板書說明各章節之基本原理與重要觀念，並要求學生於課堂中確實做筆記，作為平時成績評量之依據；另以期中考與期末考作為學生整體學習成果之評量方式。基於上述教學與評量方式，學生應秉持學術誠信原則，確保各項學習成果皆為本人之真實表現。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>This course primarily employs a lecture-based teaching method. During lectures, the basic principles and key concepts of each chapter are explained using the blackboard. Students are required to take thorough notes during class, which will serve as the basis for their performance evaluation. Midterm and final exams will be used to assess students&#39; overall learning outcomes. Based on these teaching and evaluation methods, students should uphold the principle of academic integrity and ensure that all learning outcomes reflect their true personal performance.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
